@startuml Life Scenario Flow
title Saved three-month income interruption scenario
actor User
participant "LifeScenarioPanel" as Panel
participant "Settings API" as Settings
database "user_settings" as DB
participant "Research forecast API" as Forecast
participant "portfolioProjection" as Projection

User -> Panel: Enter surplus, income loss, contribution, optional goal month
Panel -> Settings: PUT /api/settings/life_scenarios {value: definitions}
Settings -> DB: Validate and store JSONB settings
DB --> Panel: Saved definition
User -> Panel: Run comparison
Panel -> Forecast: POST baseline {monthly_contribution, goal_month?, seed}
Panel -> Forecast: POST interruption {monthly_contribution_schedule: [reduced x 3], same seed}
Forecast -> Projection: Simulate each request with live portfolio inputs
Projection --> Panel: Two distributions and optional goal probabilities
Panel -> Panel: Compare returned inputs; hide result if draft changes
Panel --> User: Approximate median difference and goal probability
@enduml
